1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,800
He's talked about security for months. Now they've got it.

2
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:06,200
He kept saying we should have a camera by the garage.

3
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:07,640
I listened and ordered one.

4
00:00:07,640 --> 00:00:10,600
No tricky setup. App, wifi, done.

5
00:00:10,600 --> 00:00:13,640
Now he sees the whole yard from his phone, wherever he is.

6
00:00:13,640 --> 00:00:16,080
You should've seen his face opening the box.

7
00:00:16,080 --> 00:00:18,400
Not just a gadget. Peace of mind.

8
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:19,800
Something he really needs.

9
00:00:19,800 --> 00:00:23,480
Best feeling, giving something that truly matters.

10
00:00:23,480 --> 00:00:27,360
Perfect for new homeowners, parents, anyone.

11
00:00:27,360 --> 00:00:28,760
When you want to protect a little extra.
